    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/2fa40c881aed81630c611ed2c3404328.avif?t=1750253768\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Vast White at your own pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solitary snowboarding journey down a vast, untamed mountain where every run is unique. <i>The Vast White</i> blends exploration, storytelling, and the thrill of the descent into a seamless open-world adventure. With only your board and your instincts, carve through pristine alpine wilderness, uncover hidden trails, and unravel the secrets buried beneath the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f <strong>An Open Mountain to Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride at your own pace through sprawling peaks, frozen forests, and secluded valleys\u2014every path you choose reveals new wonders and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.poster.avif?t=1750253768\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.webm?t=1750253768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.mp4?t=1750253768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2744\ufe0f <strong>Uncover the Mountain\u2019s Mysteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the mountain to find hidden routes, and stunning landscapes that reveal the mountain's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/e92fbd7664308200774835a290ab21f9.poster.avif?t=1750253768\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/e92fbd7664308200774835a290ab21f9.webm?t=1750253768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/e92fbd7664308200774835a290ab21f9.mp4?t=1750253768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Encounters on the Snow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with wanderers, hermits, and fellow adventurers\u2014each with their own tales, quests, and clues to hidden routes. Will you help them, or focus on the ride ahead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore <i>The Vast White</i>? Grab your board and take on the mountain like never before.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/2fa40c881aed81630c611ed2c3404328.avif?t=1750253768\" data-has-big width=800 height=138 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore The Vast White at your own pace</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a solitary snowboarding journey down a vast, untamed mountain where every run is unique. <i>The Vast White</i> blends exploration, storytelling, and the thrill of the descent into a seamless open-world adventure. With only your board and your instincts, carve through pristine alpine wilderness, uncover hidden trails, and unravel the secrets buried beneath the snow.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f <strong>An Open Mountain to Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride at your own pace through sprawling peaks, frozen forests, and secluded valleys\u2014every path you choose reveals new wonders and challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.poster.avif?t=1750253768\" width=480 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.webm?t=1750253768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/a83f36647c5fb8e2a30198fac74f2918.mp4?t=1750253768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > \u2744\ufe0f <strong>Uncover the Mountain\u2019s Mysteries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the mountain to find hidden routes, and stunning landscapes that reveal the mountain's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/e92fbd7664308200774835a290ab21f9.poster.avif?t=1750253768\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/e92fbd7664308200774835a290ab21f9.webm?t=1750253768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3301000/extras/e92fbd7664308200774835a290ab21f9.mp4?t=1750253768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udde3\ufe0f <strong>Encounters on the Snow</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cross paths with wanderers, hermits, and fellow adventurers\u2014each with their own tales, quests, and clues to hidden routes. Will you help them, or focus on the ride ahead?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to explore <i>The Vast White</i>? Grab your board and take on the mountain like never before.</p>",
